Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
8  TLS truncation:  the hybridised spinor  |\[Psi]_k\[RightAngleBracket]  and \
its Zak phase\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"1ee33169-69be-490a-a0c7-45f77f3f6cff"],

Cell["\<\
Cavity dressing couples the alpha band (0 photons) to the beta band (1 \
photon) through the interband number coefficient  \[Tilde]A_J[alpha_k, \
beta_k]  found in section 5.  Truncating the dressed problem to the two \
nearly-resonant states  {|alpha_k, 0\[RightAngleBracket], |beta_k, 1\
\[RightAngleBracket]}  gives a k-dependent two-level system whose lower \
eigenvector, lifted back to the sublattice \[TensorProduct] photon Hilbert \
space, is the hybridised chain / resonator photon state  |\[Psi]_k\
\[RightAngleBracket] .  Its Zak phase \[Gamma] = \[Integral]_0^{2\[Pi]} dk \
\[LeftAngleBracket]\[Psi]_k| i \[PartialD]_k |\[Psi]_k\[RightAngleBracket]  \
comes out quantised, and the cavity frequency omega_r is the knob that \
toggles it.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"16093705-1cab-4583-bfa3-a03315a8eac0"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["8.1  The two-level Hamiltonian", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"e944bceb-36e0-4304-8b5d-94f1ffa55e81"],

Cell["\<\
The interband coupling  gAB = \[Tilde]A_J[alpha_k, beta_k]  is purely \
imaginary:  gAB = I rho  with rho = (1 - 4 ad^2)^{1/4} Im[\[Delta]_J,k e^{-I \
ph}]  real.  Hence the pseudo-spin  h = (0, gam rho, \[CapitalDelta]/2)  with \
 \[CapitalDelta] = w_alpha - w_beta - omega_r  is PLANAR (no x-component), \
and the whole k-dependence sits in the single angle  beta_k = atan2(\
\[CapitalDelta]/2, gam rho).  New symbols:  wr = omega_r ,  gam = gamma  \
(both real, positive).  Once gAB = I rho is checked, the spinor algebra is \
carried with a REAL placeholder symbol  rho  (a big \[Delta]_J-dependent \
expression under ArcTan defeats FullSimplify); rho is put back to its closed \
form only for the numeric checks.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"691c3c61-05ef-41d6-83be-8af7d30337a9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
gAB       = AJqp[[1, 2]];                                  (* interband \
number coupling, section 5 *)
rhoClosed = (1 - 4 ad^2)^(1/4) ComplexExpand[Im[dJ Exp[-I ph]], {dJ}];   (* \
real: Cos[ph] Im[dJ] - Re[dJ] Sin[ph] *)
Print[\"gAB is purely imaginary :  gAB - I rhoClosed  ->  \", \
FullSimplify[gAB - I rhoClosed]];

Clear[rho]; $Assumptions = $Assumptions && wr > 0 && gam > 0 && rho \
\[Element] Reals;
wAlpha = Sqrt[1 + 2 ad]; wBeta = Sqrt[1 - 2 ad];
deltaTLS = wAlpha - wBeta - wr;                            (* w_alpha - \
w_beta - omega_r *)
meanTLS  = (wAlpha + wBeta + wr)/2;

HTLSraw   = {{wAlpha, -I gam rho}, {I gam rho, wBeta + wr}};             (* \
-gam gAB = -I gam rho *)
HTLSpauli = meanTLS IdentityMatrix[2] + (deltaTLS/2) PauliMatrix[3] + gam rho \
PauliMatrix[2];
Print[\"HTLS  =  mean I2 + (\[CapitalDelta]/2) sigma_z + gam rho sigma_y  ->  \
\",
      Simplify[HTLSraw - HTLSpauli]];
MatrixForm[HTLSpauli]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[189]:=",ExpressionUUID->"b5176634-a73d-4112-b289-7db15f9008d9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"gAB is purely imaginary :  gAB - I rhoClosed  ->  \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]",
    "0"}],
  SequenceForm["gAB is purely imaginary :  gAB - I rhoClosed  ->  ", 0],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9978114318829517`*^9, 3.997811494563447*^9},
 CellLabel->
