           2 $CellContext`ad)^Rational[1, 2] - $CellContext`wr)^2)^
     Rational[1, 2] + 
   Rational[1, 2] ((1 - 2 $CellContext`ad)^
      Rational[1, 2] + (1 + 2 $CellContext`ad)^
      Rational[1, 2] + $CellContext`wr)],
